# Knocking on Forbidden Doors (otherAreas 78): the shop below the purchase cost, 99999 gil, the Galka Mannequin held (pose
# 0; the chain before it completed). Update option 0: richEnough 0 (99999); 18: the Galka's pose (0). Finish option 10:
# 200 taken: race ((10 - 11) % 8) + 1 = 8 (Lua's floored %), pose floor(10 / 32) = 0; 99799 left. Option 82: 200 taken:
# race ((82 - 11) % 8) + 1 = 8, pose floor(82 / 32) = 2: the Galka's pose 2 (its exdata); 99599 left; update 18: (1, 128,
# 18, 2). The purchase short of 100000 (option 1 at 99999: delGil fails) is not in the trace: the engine's `lua: delGil`
# line is refused by the recorder; XI.Verify.Quests `oa g4 kofd` proves it.
lists Mhaura/Fyi_Chalmwoh/onTrigger Mhaura/Fyi_Chalmwoh/onTrade Mhaura/onEventUpdate/321 Mhaura/onEventFinish/319 Mhaura/onEventFinish/321
char zone=Mhaura pos=-37.8,-16,70.1 job=WAR lvl=30 gil=99999
